  <section id="rooms">
    <h2>Room types, sizes and beds</h2>
    <p>All-Star Music is two products in one resort. Standard and Preferred rooms are a typical Value room. Family Suites are larger, with a separate sleeping area, two bathrooms and a kitchenette. Official room listings describe standard and Preferred views of the courtyard, pool or parking area. Preferred rooms are listed as close to Melody Hall, dining, shopping and transportation. Family Suites are listed with views of the pool, courtyard or parking area.</p>
