    <h3>What's in the room</h3>
    <p>In a standard room, the queen-size table bed folds down from a table. In a family suite, official listings show one queen and two queen-size pull-down beds, which is how the room sleeps six. We have not confirmed a current, complete in-room list of our own for either product <span class="verify">[verify current in-room amenities]</span>.</p>
