  <section id="transport">
    <h2>Getting to the parks</h2>
    <p>Buses are the only free Disney transportation from All-Star Music. They run to all four theme parks, the water parks and Disney Springs. There is no Skyliner, monorail or boat from this resort. The bus stop is at Melody Hall.</p>
