  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Calypso Pool</strong> is the main pool. Official pages list it at 251,418 gallons and describe a guitar-shaped pool with a Three Caballeros fountain in the center. A kiddie pool is behind Melody Hall. Official pages also mention movies under the stars at this pool on select nights.</li>
      <li><strong>Piano Pool</strong> is the quieter leisure pool, shaped like a grand piano. Official pages list it at 106,036 gallons.</li>
      <li>Towels are free at the pools. Hours and lifeguard coverage vary and can change.</li>
    </ul>
